# For libraries, Cargo.lock should be IGNORED. For binaries, commit it.
# This repo produces binaries (http-server), but workspace root has many
# libraries; follow standard practice and add at binary-crate level.
# We keep it ignored here to avoid noise. Add back if doing release builds.
Cargo.lock

